{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13446","headline":"变律 一 · 苏涣","name":"变律 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月东西行，寒暑冬夏易。\n阴阳无停机，造化渺莫测。\n开目爲晨光，闭目爲夜色。\n一开复一闭，明晦无休息。\n居然六合外，旷哉天地德。\n天地且不言，世人浪喧喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}